# compose/

Local development environment configuration using Docker Compose. Orchestrates PostgreSQL 16 (the Udex datastore and Hydra metadata database) and Ory Hydra v26.2.0 (OAuth2 authorization server) with health checks and dependency ordering. Secrets are generated via `scripts/gen-env.sh` and written to `.env` before startup.

## Dirs

- `postgres/` -- One-shot initialization scripts run on PostgreSQL container startup; creates the hydra user and database

## Files

- `docker-compose.yml` -- Service orchestration: postgres (datastore), hydra-migrate (schema), hydra (OAuth2 server); includes health checks and resource limits
- `README.md` -- Setup guide, service endpoints, prerequisites, persistence model, and directory layout
